{"metadata":{"title":"DocumentConfiguration","modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit21DocumentConfigurationO","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"symbolKind":"enum","role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration\/versionMapKey"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Type Properties"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To instruct OpenAPIKit to decode OpenAPI Standards versions it does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively support, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo[DocumentConfiguration.versionMapKey] = [\"3.5.0\": OpenAPI.Document.Version.v3_1_1]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"That will cause OpenAPIKit to accept OAS v3.5.0 on decode and treat it as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the natively supported v3.1.1. This feature exists to allow OpenAPIKit to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"be configured to parse future versions of the OAS standard that are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"determined (by you) to be backwards compatible with a previous version","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prior to OpenAPIKit gaining official support for the new version and its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"features.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit"]]},"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit":{"abstract":[],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit","url":"\/documentation\/openapikit","title":"OpenAPIKit","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/DocumentConfiguration":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"DocumentConfiguration","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration"},"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/DocumentConfiguration/versionMapKey":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration\/versionMapKey","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"versionMapKey","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CodingUserInfoKey","precis